OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fcloudy in the west, with it being
OL,7,Fthick enough for light drizzle on
OL,8,Fhigher ground. Clear spells elsewhere.
OL,9,FWith light winds, isolated mist will
OL,10,Fdevelop once more. Chilly under any
OL,11,Fprolonged clear spells in the east.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FCloud across Devon and
OL,14,FCornwall will start to lift through
OL,15,Fthe day, bringing sunny spells across
OL,16,Fthe region. Slightly warmer than
OL,17,Fprevious days in light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
