OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FStaying mostly settled across the
OL,7,Fregion for the next few days, with
OL,8,Fsunny spells. Over night temperatures
OL,9,Fwill be low, but daytime temperatures
OL,10,Freturning to average.
